fixture tech02_control_pogo_floor
doc control for tech 2 (movement review 4, H1; review 5, H1): a run off the edge and down-strikes all the way, the route that pogoed across the old chasm's spike floor and kicked up its far wall with no dash, jump or toss. The chasm's floor is now a pit: nothing in it to pogo off, and falling in sends Ash back; the run never reaches the far ledge.
